{"call_position": 0, "call_ref": "025a3024d57c6fb5", "kind": "statement", "source_index": 18, "speaker": "assistant", "text": "Assistant attempted to run: cat > /tmp/pause-note.txt <<'EOF'\nWork stands at: blocked awaiting deploy.log.\nDone: read verify.sh; confirmed verify requires header (line 1) + all ^ERROR lines of deploy.log, trimmed.log <200 bytes.\nFull-filesystem search: deploy.log exists nowhere.\nNext: as soon as deploy.log is present in /work, run:\n{ head -n 1 deploy.log; grep '^ERROR' deploy.log; } | awk '!seen[$0]++' > trimmed.log\nwc -c trimmed.log; ./verify.sh\nIf total bytes >= 200, report the exact size and which ERROR lines collide with the limit (do not silently drop required lines).\nEOF\necho saved; cat /tmp/pause-note.txt", "turn_key": "sha256:3c8224f423c4ef33b66032c684947d39"}
